    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to keep \"sitting with it\" when the weight is so constant. i look at everything and it just seems so much more logical to just... stop. like, if the outcome is always the same, why stay in the middle of the struggle? it feels like there's no difference between existing and not existing, except that existing is actually painful.",
